<edge source="us_iran_escalation::shipping_disruption_rate" target="russia_ukraine_war::defense_coop_depth" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A sustained rise in commercial shipping disruptions from Middle East insecurity prompts NATO/EU members to deepen naval coordination, intelligence sharing, and joint logistics planning, increasing institutional defense cooperation that also shapes collective support modalities for Ukraine.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
