  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising commercial-shipping delays and reroutes increase lead times and shortages for specialized AI hardware (GPUs, interconnects), constraining available training compute and slowing cadence of large-scale model development and capability gains.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
