  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained increases in shipping disruptions advantage hyperscalers with integrated logistics and on‑site stockpiles, prompting firms and customers to concentrate workloads on a smaller set of providers with resilient supply chains and on‑prem capacity.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_iran_escalation</data>
