  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">An Iran‑related spike in global oil prices raises Russian energy revenues and short‑term fiscal space, enabling Moscow to allocate a larger share of GDP to defense expenditures for the Ukraine campaign.</data>
