  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Deeper formalized defense cooperation leads allied governments and contractors to pool requirements and procure shared secure cloud and edge platforms from a small set of vetted vendors, concentrating critical AI infrastructure under those providers.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
