  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising investment into AI (particularly in surveillance, analytics and sanctions‑compliance tools) expands capabilities used by state and corporate actors to monitor, target and enforce measures against Venezuelan oil activity, thereby increasing external (especially US) geopolitical influence over the resource domain.</data>
