<edge source="us_china_tech_rivalry::market_concentration_ai" target="global_financial_stress::implied_volatility" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Greater market concentration raises the systemic importance of a handful of firms so that any geopolitical shock, sanctions, or operational problem at a dominant provider causes spikes in option-implied volatility across tech-heavy and broad indices as investors reprices tail risk.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">global_financial_stress</data>
</edge>
<edge source="us_china_tech_rivalry::market_concentration_ai" target="russia_ukraine_war::arms_transfer_volume" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">High concentration of AI suppliers in jurisdictions aligned with export-control regimes makes coordinated denial of AI-enabled components and platforms to Russia easier, reducing the volume/value of advanced arms transfers to Russia.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="us_china_tech_rivalry::market_concentration_ai" target="us_iran_escalation::shipping_disruption_rate" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">If a few dominant cloud/AI providers suspend services (satcom, routing/analytics, insurance-pricing models) to vessels, brokers or insurers linked to Iran in response to sanctions or compliance risk, affected shipping is delayed, rerouted, or halted, raising disruption rates.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_escalation</data>
</edge>
<edge source="us_china_tech_rivalry::market_concentration_ai" target="us_iran_escalation::oil_export_capacity" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Dominant platform and data providers can effectively block Iranian exporters from essential services (trading platforms, satellite navigation/monitoring, insurance underwriting), which reduces the practical ability of Iran to move and sell oil despite physical production.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_escalation</data>
</edge>
