  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Concentration of critical AI infrastructure in a few operators creates single points of failure and sanction/attack targets such that an outage or regulatory action against one provider triggers rapid deleveraging and margin calls that widen bid-ask spreads and withdraw liquidity from related cash and repo markets.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">global_financial_stress</data>
