  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Centralized AI/cloud infrastructure under Western control enables rapid provision of high-end ISR and target‑planning AI services to Ukrainian forces, increasing tempo and precision of kinetic strikes.</data>
