  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in Venezuelan oil output depresses regional energy and fuel costs, lowering operational barriers for smaller, local datacenters and edge deployments and thereby reducing concentration of AI infrastructure in a few large, centralized operators.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_venezuelan_oil</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
