  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A higher share of external ownership sustains cross-border holdings and trading interest in Venezuela/US-linked energy securities, supporting secondary-market depth and lowering transaction costs; the reverse (loss of external owners) dries up liquidity.</data>
