  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A rising share of external (particularly U.S./Western) ownership in Venezuelan oil assets gives external actors leverage to restrict or redirect shipments to Russia, cutting Russian export revenue and reducing the fiscal capacity to sustain overseas arms transfers.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
