  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A sustained upward revision to expected policy rates tightens near-term financing and dims growth/demand outlooks, reducing expected crude consumption and exerting downward pressure on global oil benchmark prices.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_financial_stress</data>
