  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A sustained rise in long-term sovereign yields raises governments' debt-servicing burdens and crowding-out pressures on discretionary budgets, making it politically and fiscally harder to preserve or increase defense outlays as a share of GDP.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
