  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising long‑term sovereign yields increase the cost of capital and refinancing for upstream producers, tanker owners and port infrastructure projects, delaying maintenance and investment and thereby reducing available physical export capacity over the medium term.</data>
